WEBVTT

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:10.900
<i>What I saw on Hana-sensei's scroll...</i>

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:14.250
<i>It was the same as Rindou's drawing.</i>

00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:17.590
<i>Is that really what men look like?</i>

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:21.080
<i>It's just so different 
from what I was expecting!</i>

00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:24.400
<i>For now, I'd better focus on training,</i>

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:26.820
<i>and think about it as little as possible.</i>

00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:36.230
<i>While Sensei is away, I'm the one 
in charge of our class' village.</i>

00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:38.770
<i>I've got to keep it together!</i>

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:14.070
<b>Showdown! Akane Class vs. the Man!?</b>

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:14.190
Hey!

00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:18.200
Everybody quiet down!

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:20.190
<b>Self-study</b>

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:20.190
Let's study like we're supposed to!

00:02:20.190 --> 00:02:22.580
Aw, come on. 
Don't be so stuck on the rules.

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:27.000
She's right. Both Hana-sensei 
and Konoha-sensei are away.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:29.920
They'll never find out we were slacking.

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:30.830
None of that!

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:34.910
Sensei left me in charge of everyone!

00:02:34.910 --> 00:02:37.090
Tsubaki is so serious.

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:39.620
Then how about some special training?

00:02:39.620 --> 00:02:40.470
Special training?

00:02:41.480 --> 00:02:43.430
Special Attractiveness Jutsu training.

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:46.040
You never learn.

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:48.910
But I'd be willing to, in that case.

00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:49.730
Huh?

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:52.200
Tsubaki, show us how it's done.

00:02:52.590 --> 00:02:54.610
N-None of that, either!

00:02:54.950 --> 00:02:58.480
Let's just review past lessons 
or prepare for upcoming ones!

00:02:58.480 --> 00:02:59.610
Aww.

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:03.490
But won't we need Attractiveness Jutsu 
when it comes time to defeat a man?

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:05.370
Defeat a man...

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:07.940
Hey, more importantly.

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:10.410
Should you be ignoring that?

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:11.610
Too slow!

00:03:11.610 --> 00:03:13.150
Wait up!

00:03:14.530 --> 00:03:16.430
Stop it!

00:03:16.430 --> 00:03:18.200
Get back here!

00:03:17.390 --> 00:03:19.480
It's not easy being Tsubaki.

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:19.480
Run for it!

00:03:19.480 --> 00:03:20.810
Run! Run!

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:25.100
I thought I told you to study!

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:29.100
We won't lose!

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:30.970
Throw! Throw! Throw!

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:32.980
Throw! Throw! Throw!

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:38.730
Mind over matter! Willpower! Willpower!

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:42.020
I bet a man's face looks like this!

00:03:42.020 --> 00:03:45.130
If you smoosh your face too much, you'll die.

00:03:45.130 --> 00:03:46.980
Don't you think it's like this?

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:51.510
This worldview is too novel, 
and it's liable to win me over!

00:03:51.510 --> 00:03:54.040
Once that happens, I'll wind up dead!

00:04:00.560 --> 00:04:02.090
You spilled the water!

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:03.490
You're gonna be in trouble.

00:04:03.490 --> 00:04:05.570
You're gonna be in trouble!

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:13.370
Today sure was rough.

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:16.270
It was. I am <i>so</i> tired.

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:19.820
I didn't know it would be 
so rough with Sensei away.

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:21.470
Nee-sama.

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:24.330
Let's sleep together.

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:27.070
I can't eat another bite.

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:30.790
It's not exactly rough for them.

00:04:32.180 --> 00:04:34.350
I worry about what's coming.

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:42.430
What's all that?!

00:04:44.730 --> 00:04:47.340
Tsubaki! There must be something outside!

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:49.050
I'll go take a look!

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:54.390
Rindou, Mokuren. 
Tell everyone else to stay inside!

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:13.660
What's that?

00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:28.180
The village!

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:30.110
How could this happen?

00:05:30.110 --> 00:05:31.180
It's terrible!

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:32.970
Who would do such a thing?!

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:37.950
Look at this!

00:05:37.950 --> 00:05:39.690
My potatoes!

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:42.160
I worked so hard to grow them!

00:05:42.160 --> 00:05:43.320
There, there.

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:45.810
The vandal might still be nearby.

00:05:45.810 --> 00:05:47.200
Let's all go teach 'em a lesson!

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:49.360
Couldn't we win with this many of us?

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:51.320
Let's get going, then!

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:52.480
Hold on a minute.

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:56.410
It might be dangerous to pursue right away.

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:57.640
Why?

00:05:57.640 --> 00:05:58.970
Take a look at that.

00:05:59.640 --> 00:06:01.640
Whoa, big footprint!

00:06:01.640 --> 00:06:03.900
Which means a big body?

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:06.840
Looks like we'd best make preparations first.

00:06:07.180 --> 00:06:08.900
But from the look of things, they were alone.

00:06:08.900 --> 00:06:10.300
Who the heck was it?

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:14.780
It might have been... a man.

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:19.700
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:21.210
Did you see him, Tsubaki?!

00:06:21.210 --> 00:06:25.760
No, but it was dark, 
so I might have been seeing things.

00:06:25.760 --> 00:06:27.950
Or maybe you weren't.

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:30.850
Rindou?

00:06:31.350 --> 00:06:34.680
At the village where I used to live,

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:37.260
I heard about bandits.

00:06:37.260 --> 00:06:38.870
Bandits?

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:44.240
Yeah. That there are savage men who 
typically lurk in the mountains,

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:46.000
and attack people to steal their valuables.

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:47.260
What gives?!

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:49.140
One of them ransacked the village?

00:06:49.140 --> 00:06:50.940
Talk about barbaric!

00:06:50.940 --> 00:06:53.040
But nothing was stolen.

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:54.640
Just stuff destroyed here and there.

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:58.200
Maybe yesterday, he was just scouting.

00:06:58.200 --> 00:07:01.800
Meaning, he might come back again tonight?

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:04.900
If something like that 
comes back again, I'll die.

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:06.140
How distressing.

00:07:06.140 --> 00:07:07.650
How scary.

00:07:07.980 --> 00:07:09.000
What do we do?

00:07:13.230 --> 00:07:15.810
What do we have to be afraid of?

00:07:15.810 --> 00:07:17.240
Hinagiku?

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:20.330
If that's how it is, let's fight back!

00:07:20.980 --> 00:07:23.030
Kick the man's butt, you mean?

00:07:23.030 --> 00:07:24.330
Of course.

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:26.260
Well said, Hinagiku!

00:07:26.260 --> 00:07:31.480
She's right. We can't just let it slide 
after he messed up the village!

00:07:32.790 --> 00:07:34.880
<i>A barbaric man, here at the village...</i>

00:07:35.370 --> 00:07:38.290
<i>And while Sensei's away, of all times!</i>

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:41.080
Let's all protect this village!

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:42.520
Yeah!

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:43.050
Okay!

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:43.050
We'll get him!

00:07:43.050 --> 00:07:44.940
But don't do anything unreasonable.

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:47.190
Let's prioritize strengthening our defenses.

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:48.220
Okay, Nee-sama!

00:07:48.220 --> 00:07:49.850
We'll get it done!

00:07:49.850 --> 00:07:52.180
Okay, let's work up a plan.

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:55.720
How about we designate posts, 
and patrol in shifts?

00:07:55.720 --> 00:07:58.550
It might get tricky once he's in the village.

00:07:58.550 --> 00:08:00.570
Let's expand our scope 
into the nearby forest.

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:03.340
Count on us to stand guard over there.

00:08:03.340 --> 00:08:05.740
We're going to need lots of traps.

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:20.680
It's my shift for the watch.

00:08:21.470 --> 00:08:22.920
That time already?

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:23.980
Yes.

00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:28.760
I just hope tonight remains this quiet.

00:08:28.760 --> 00:08:29.990
Hey, Tsubaki.

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:34.820
Why don't you and I go get rid of the man?

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:35.460
Huh?

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:38.760
We even roped in girls who 
wouldn't do well in a fight.

00:08:38.760 --> 00:08:40.580
Won't they simply get in the way?

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:44.010
So let's just you and me track this guy down.

00:08:44.010 --> 00:08:45.460
I can't do that.

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:47.950
Wait, why not?!

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:52.300
It's dangerous to attack first 
when it's unclear what his goal is.

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:54.570
But, you and I could...!

00:08:56.180 --> 00:09:01.380
We don't even know where he's 
lurking, or from where he'll attack.

00:09:01.380 --> 00:09:03.730
We can't afford to be away from the village.

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:06.220
Right now, we should tighten our defenses.

00:09:06.780 --> 00:09:07.760
Ah, okay.

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:10.740
Do what you want, then.

00:09:10.740 --> 00:09:12.100
Benisumomo?

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:16.240
Tsubaki! I brought a midnight snack!

00:09:21.350 --> 00:09:22.510
What's wrong?

00:09:23.780 --> 00:09:26.590
So, that's what happened.

00:09:26.590 --> 00:09:27.580
Yes.

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:30.350
That's Benisumomo for you, though.

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:35.720
Hey, Tsubaki, do you remember what 
happened when we were little?

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:39.440
Mokuren!

00:09:39.440 --> 00:09:40.510
A-Are you okay?!

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:46.920
Hinagiku, guard Mokuren!

00:09:46.920 --> 00:09:48.270
Y-Yeah!

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:51.980
Don't come here! Go somewhere else!

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:55.270
Benisumomo stood up for us.

00:09:55.270 --> 00:09:56.190
Yes.

00:09:58.620 --> 00:10:00.260
I'm sure she will this time, too.

00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:05.250
She didn't want other 
girls exposed to danger.

00:10:07.130 --> 00:10:10.830
Benisumomo has always been that way.

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:17.800
Uh, what is it?

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:19.930
Oh, nothing.

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:22.260
R-Really?

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:28.240
He's here! Over by the storehouses!

00:10:28.240 --> 00:10:29.090
Let's go!

00:10:29.090 --> 00:10:29.850
Okay!

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:36.400
Here he comes!

00:10:36.730 --> 00:10:38.590
But we set so many traps.

00:10:38.590 --> 00:10:40.490
Guess he got past all of them!

00:10:40.980 --> 00:10:43.240
This is as far as you go!

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:44.990
Higiri, headed your way!

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:46.910
Whirlwind Jutsu!

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:53.090
How does he move like that?!

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:55.500
No, you don't!

00:10:56.360 --> 00:10:57.210
Gotcha!

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:03.610
I wish to fight you, man.

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:04.820
Here I come!

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:08.930
Fire Style!

00:11:12.120 --> 00:11:13.190
Hey, hey!

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:15.570
Over here, man!

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:16.020
Huh?!

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:18.110
Ajisai!

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:24.770
Ajisai, are you okay?!

00:11:24.770 --> 00:11:26.380
He slimed me!

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:28.120
<i>That</i> was a man?

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:29.370
Here goes!

00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:31.290
Transform!

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:43.110
Rindou! Attack from both sides!

00:11:43.110 --> 00:11:44.610
Okay, you got it!

00:11:45.690 --> 00:11:47.060
Okay, here goes!

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:49.500
Rindou?!

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:51.570
What is this?!

00:11:51.570 --> 00:11:53.600
Sorry. Are you okay?

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:58.330
I rarely get a chance like 
this, so I went overboard.

00:11:58.330 --> 00:12:00.070
Mizubashou!

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:04.490
If he catches us, we'll die!

00:12:05.590 --> 00:12:06.830
Here he comes!

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:08.600
K-Kagetsu, you go first!

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:11.490
I-I can't! You go, Mukuge!

00:12:11.490 --> 00:12:13.020
No way! Hototogisu, you—

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:14.420
You three!

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:17.810
Move aside.

00:12:17.810 --> 00:12:21.420
I can take on a man, no problem at all.

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:24.430
You're the cutest in the world, Hinagiku!

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:25.140
Mhm.

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:26.220
Naturally.

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:28.220
Hinagiku!

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:29.350
Let's go!

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:31.140
Take this!

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:33.790
Attractiveness Jutsu!

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:39.390
Hinagiku!

00:12:39.390 --> 00:12:43.700
What is this?! It's all sticky! 
And it sort of stinks!

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:46.490
You're cute even if you stink, Hinagiku.

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:50.200
Attractiveness Jutsu doesn't 
work on men at all!

00:12:51.560 --> 00:12:53.410
That's far enough!

00:12:55.730 --> 00:12:57.580
We got ahead of him!

00:12:57.580 --> 00:13:02.170
Asagao. The time has finally 
come to unveil <i>that</i>!

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:05.680
Yeah! What made even Konoha-sensei tremble!

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:08.010
Our final secret technique!

00:13:08.420 --> 00:13:09.650
Here goes!

00:13:09.650 --> 00:13:11.010
You got it!

00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:13.770
Gaching!

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:14.980
Gaching!

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:16.210
Gaching!

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:17.730
Gaching!

00:13:18.870 --> 00:13:19.880
Vween!

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:21.430
Vween!

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:25.240
Boom!

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:28.880
Asagao's physical ability, 
and my command ability...

00:13:28.880 --> 00:13:32.370
If we combine those and cover 
each other's weak points,

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:34.110
we're invincible!

00:13:34.110 --> 00:13:38.170
And when we combine, 
the effects are multiplied!

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:40.290
Here we go!

00:13:43.790 --> 00:13:46.050
Just you wait!

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:50.020
Stop flailing!

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:54.740
Hey! Where were you looking?!

00:13:54.740 --> 00:13:56.730
It's your fault, Sazanka!

00:14:12.430 --> 00:14:15.870
I won't let you... go any farther!

00:14:35.730 --> 00:14:37.130
I'll help.

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:39.230
You're protecting the village, right?

00:14:40.970 --> 00:14:42.310
Please do!

00:14:48.050 --> 00:14:50.030
Let's go, Benisumomo!

00:14:48.050 --> 00:14:50.030
Let's go, Tsubaki!

00:14:58.460 --> 00:14:59.460
Ow!

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:07.510
Tsubaki-chan's still fighting.

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:11.730
You can do it, Nee-sama!

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:15.930
Tsubaki!

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:16.920
You're going nowhere!

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:41.540
Huh?

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:48.000
Huh?

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:54.760
A monkey?

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:57.180
An octopus?

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:05.290
Not a man?

00:16:06.050 --> 00:16:08.440
Go! Go!

00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:09.990
Asagao!

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:13.320
We're right in the middle 
of our eating contest!

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:13.320
<b>Eating Contest</b>

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:17.080
Dokudami, champion for three years 
running, has roared into the lead!

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:19.660
And Asagao is right behind her!

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:21.650
Tachiaoi seems to be having trouble!

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:25.420
And Itadori is gaining, little by little!

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:28.080
Go for it, Asagao!

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:32.680
Tsubaki.

00:16:33.070 --> 00:16:34.120
Yes, ma'am!

00:16:34.120 --> 00:16:36.400
You did well the other day.

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:38.940
I hear you brought everyone together.

00:16:39.370 --> 00:16:41.900
It's good that you aided the 
village in its time of crisis.

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:47.910
No... Rather, I guessed wrong that it was 
a man, and blew things out of proportion.

00:16:47.910 --> 00:16:49.120
I'm sorry.

00:16:51.390 --> 00:16:53.900
At least, it got no worse than that.

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:54.780
Yes, ma'am.

00:16:56.450 --> 00:17:00.570
It's true that some men 
are brutal and dangerous.

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:01.880
But...

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:07.680
Remember that not all of them are bad.

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:13.130
I think I told you once before.

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:19.260
Falling in love with a member of the 
opposite sex is a natural thing.

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:26.880
Maybe the day will come 
when you love someone, too.

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:31.070
Me, too?

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:38.120
That is all. You may go.

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:40.280
Yes, ma'am, if you'll excu—

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:41.130
Oh, right.

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:43.160
One more thing.

00:17:43.480 --> 00:17:45.440
I think you realize this,

00:17:45.440 --> 00:17:50.380
but be sure not to tell anyone about that 
scrawled-over scroll from the other day.

00:17:50.740 --> 00:17:51.540
Yes, ma'am!

00:17:53.350 --> 00:17:54.660
Scroll?

00:17:57.740 --> 00:17:59.040
What's that all about?

00:18:01.550 --> 00:18:03.280
Nothing.

00:18:03.280 --> 00:18:05.510
I never could sense your presence.

00:18:06.370 --> 00:18:08.350
No more...

00:18:09.990 --> 00:18:10.670
Hey!

00:18:10.670 --> 00:18:11.820
You okay?!

00:18:11.820 --> 00:18:15.000
Be strong! I did tell you not to overdo it.

00:18:12.850 --> 00:18:13.780
Itadori!

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:15.000
Another helping!

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:18.470
Oh, my! Dokudami eats her eleventh!

00:18:18.470 --> 00:18:21.230
That puts her in the lead 
over second-place Asagao!

00:18:21.230 --> 00:18:23.760
Thanks for covering while I was away.

00:18:23.760 --> 00:18:29.560
Hey, no problem. Your students 
did all the work for me, anyway.

00:18:26.350 --> 00:18:28.500
What're you doing, Asagao?!

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:31.380
You don't lose to anyone, 
when it comes to eating!

00:18:29.560 --> 00:18:30.560
I see.

00:18:30.560 --> 00:18:33.400
What do you think of the 
Akane Class kunoichi?

00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:33.750
Do this right!

00:18:33.400 --> 00:18:35.200
They're all doing their best.

00:18:35.200 --> 00:18:38.200
Especially that one who was just here?

00:18:38.200 --> 00:18:38.720
Yes.

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:44.440
I'm thinking of someday leaving 
Akane Class in Tsubaki's hands.

00:18:45.750 --> 00:18:47.310
Nee-sama!

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:49.870
I won, Tsubaki-chan!

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:51.910
Asagao was amazing!

00:18:51.910 --> 00:18:53.530
I knew you could do it.

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:57.150
Go on, Sazanka. Show it to her.

00:18:57.650 --> 00:19:01.780
I gave her the hair ribbon I got for winning!

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:03.230
It looks good on you.

00:19:04.510 --> 00:19:06.200
Thank you!

00:19:06.760 --> 00:19:09.940
Thanks for cheering for me, Sazanka.

00:19:10.840 --> 00:19:13.670
If you can't win here, 
you really are just an overeater.

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:16.430
There you go again!

00:19:16.430 --> 00:19:20.690
As a fellow member of Team Dog, 
I can't have you looking pathetic!

00:19:20.690 --> 00:19:22.800
But how do you <i>really</i> feel?

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:30.780
Men aren't so bad, huh?

00:19:32.260 --> 00:19:35.770
Will the day come for me, too?

00:19:37.260 --> 00:19:39.380
When I meet an actual man?

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:43.200
And, when I fall in love?

00:19:43.950 --> 00:19:45.740
I think you realize this,

00:19:46.340 --> 00:19:51.540
but be sure not to tell anyone about that 
scrawled-over scroll from the other day.

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:55.790
Huh?

00:19:55.790 --> 00:19:57.690
"Scrawled-over"?

00:19:59.400 --> 00:20:01.260
Oh, Tsubaki.

00:20:01.530 --> 00:20:03.290
They're both already asleep.

00:20:03.710 --> 00:20:04.960
Okay.

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:10.060
Look, I'd say Sazanka took 
quite a liking to it.

00:20:14.230 --> 00:20:16.270
It's time I too got some—

00:20:17.790 --> 00:20:19.650
Rindou, that...

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:22.200
Oh, this?

00:20:22.610 --> 00:20:26.340
Sazanka and Asagao. 
Because they're so cute when they sleep.

00:20:27.510 --> 00:20:30.460
Sazanka and Asagao?

00:20:31.670 --> 00:20:35.600
See, don't you think Sazanka's 
hair ribbon here came out well?

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:36.830
Hair ribbon?

00:20:37.140 --> 00:20:39.460
Oh, yes. I drew you, too, Tsubaki.

00:20:39.460 --> 00:20:40.700
Take a look.

00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:45.640
Tsubaki?

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:47.240
So that's it.

00:20:47.240 --> 00:20:47.890
Huh?

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:50.630
So <i>that's</i> it!

00:20:54.160 --> 00:20:57.950
Time to get up! Let's go to breakfast!

00:20:57.950 --> 00:20:59.120
Breakfast!

00:20:59.120 --> 00:21:01.760
Good morning, Nee-sama!

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:03.270
Morning.

00:21:03.270 --> 00:21:06.950
Time for another day full of training!

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:13.450
<b>Dining
Hall</b>

00:21:19.680 --> 00:21:23.630
<i>Men are horrible. Things to be feared.</i>

00:21:24.570 --> 00:21:27.720
<i>But, why is it?</i>

00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:30.180
<i>Why is my heart beating so fast?</i>

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:35.890
<i>I feel sort of happy, a little 
embarrassed, and excited.</i>

00:21:36.720 --> 00:21:43.660
<i>I want to put this feeling 
away for safe keeping.</i>

00:21:47.060 --> 00:21:49.680
<i>Until someday, when I find love.</i>

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:52.620
Hey, Tsubaki.

00:21:53.150 --> 00:21:55.210
Did something good happen, by chance?

00:21:55.210 --> 00:21:56.480
What, what?

00:21:56.480 --> 00:21:58.250
Is it true, Nee-sama?

00:22:04.490 --> 00:22:05.820
It's a secret.

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>The End

00:23:37.620 --> 00:23:38.820
The end!
